# ============================================================================
# Verdant .gitignore
# ============================================================================

# --- RESEARCH WORKSPACE: NEVER COMMIT, NEVER PUSH --------------------------
# The RESOURCES/ directory is the research workspace. Nothing inside it may
# ever enter the repository under any circumstance. See RULES.md (Rule 0,
# Rule C) and PLAN.md (the Observatory). This entry is a safety belt, not the
# policy itself — the policy is that research material never leaves RESOURCES.
RESOURCES/
resources/
RESOURCES
**/RESOURCES/

# --- Proprietary material: defense in depth --------------------------------
# These must never appear anywhere in the tree, inside RESOURCES or not.
*.keys
prod.keys
title.keys
dev.keys
*.bin.enc
Firmware*.zip
firmware*.zip
*.nca
*.nsp
*.xci
*.nso
*.kip
*.istorage
package1
package2
BOOT0
BOOT1
PRODINFO*

# --- Build output ----------------------------------------------------------
/build/
/out/
*.o
*.a
*.elf
*.nro
*.lst
*.map

# --- Tooling / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Research tooling artifacts (in case a tool is ever run near the tree) --
*.gpr          # Ghidra project
*.rep          # Ghidra repository
*.i64 *.idb    # IDA databases
*.bndb         # Binary Ninja
verdant-horizon.rep/
.gitignore
